OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will turn
OL,6,Fwet and breezier tonight rain arrives
OL,7,Fand sweeps across Wales through the
OL,8,Fmorning. Temperatures recover in the
OL,9,Fwest, but still chilly inland with
OL,10,Fpatchy frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FIt will be a rather damp and
OL,13,Fmurky day on Friday, with persistent
OL,14,Frain and widespread low cloud. Winds
OL,15,Ftend to ease and it will feel less
OL,16,Fcold than Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
