OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThe
OL,6,Fweekend will likely be unsettled at
OL,7,Ffirst with strong winds and heavy
OL,8,Frain, but conditions becoming drier
OL,9,Fand brighter by sunday, with isolated
OL,10,Fshowers. Trending milder and windier
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
